flowchart TD
 S[Start workflow + code version] --> H[Append workflow history]
 H --> D[Deterministic replay runtime]
 D --> A[Schedule activity + idempotency key]
 A --> Q[Activity task queue]
 Q --> C[Worker claims lease + fence]
 C --> W[Execute side effect + heartbeat]
 W --> R[Persist activity result]
 R --> H
 W -->|Worker crash| E[Lease expires]
 E --> N[New worker claims higher fence]
 N --> D
 G[External signal] --> SG[Authenticate + deduplicate signal]
 SG --> H
 H -->|History threshold| K[Continue-as-new compact state]
 K --> S2[New linked workflow run]
